# DDI v1 for the k46 line: the names a module may resolve in the kernel's
# symbol block (docs/contracts/C3-2-symbols-and-ddi.md section 3).  One line
# per name: name, func or data, the kabi minor it entered.  The kernel build
# generates its block from this file (mkksym -a) and the post-link gate
# (tools/ksymgate.py) checks every name is defined.  Sorted by name.
